#. type: Title-text
#: ../scene.txt:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Spiders 1"
msgstr "Ragni 1"

#. type: Resume-text
#: ../scene.txt:2
#, no-wrap
msgid "Kill three spiders with a small program."
msgstr "Elimina tre ragni con un piccolo programma."

#. type: ScriptName-text
#: ../scene.txt:3
#, no-wrap
msgid "Spider1"
msgstr "Spider1"

#. type: \b; header
#: ../help/help.E.txt:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Objective"
msgstr "Obiettivo"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../help/help.E.txt:2
#, no-wrap
msgid "Write a small program to kill three spiders."
msgstr "Scrivi un piccolo programma per eliminare tre ragni."

#. type: \t; header
#: ../help/help.E.txt:4
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure"
msgstr "Procedura"

#. type: Bullet: '1)'
#: ../help/help.E.txt:5
#, no-wrap
msgid "In order to program the bot, select it."
msgstr "Seleziona il robot per programmarlo."

#. type: Bullet: '2)'
#: ../help/help.E.txt:6
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The numbers 1 to 4 corresponding to the programs contained in the bot appear"
" on the lower left-hand corner of your screen. Select the first line."
msgstr ""
"In basso a sinistra compaiono i numeri da 1 a 4 dei suoi programmi. "
"Seleziona la prima riga."

#. type: Bullet: '3)'
#: ../help/help.E.txt:7
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Click the button with the braces <button 22/>, and you will arrive in an "
"editor where you can write the program."
msgstr "Premi il pulsante con le graffe <button 22/> per aprire l’editor."

#. type: Bullet: '4)'
#: ../help/help.E.txt:8
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"While you are writing the program, the key <format key><key help/></format> "
"will display the text you are reading right now. When you have finished "
"writing the program, click the \"OK\" button."
msgstr ""
"Durante la scrittura, <format key><key help/></format> mostra queste "
"istruzioni. Al termine premi «OK»."

#. type: Bullet: '5)'
#: ../help/help.E.txt:9
#, no-wrap
msgid "In order to execute the program, click the arrow button <button 21/>."
msgstr "Per eseguire il programma premi la freccia <button 21/>."

#. type: \t; header
#: ../help/help.E.txt:11
#, no-wrap
msgid "Program"
msgstr "Programma"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../help/help.E.txt:12
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"You must tell the bot exactly step by step what it must do in order to kill "
"the three spiders. The bot understands only precise instructions, which it "
"will execute one after another."
msgstr ""
"Indica al robot, passo dopo passo, cosa fare per eliminare i tre ragni. "
"Capisce soltanto istruzioni precise, che esegue in sequenza."

#. type: Plain text
#: ../help/help.E.txt:14
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"When you click the braces button <button 22/> in order to write the program,"
" a part of the program will already be there:"
msgstr ""
"Aprendo l’editor con <button 22/>, troverai già una parte del programma:"

#. type: Source code
#: ../help/help.E.txt:16
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"extern void object::Spider1( )\n"
"{\n"
"\t\n"
"\t<n/>write your program here ...<c/>\n"
"\t\n"
"}"
msgstr ""
"extern void object::Spider1( )\n"
"{\n"
"\t\n"
"\t<n/>write your program here ...<c/>\n"
"\t\n"
"}"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../help/help.E.txt:23
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Everything that is already written when you arrive in the editor must not be"
" altered. Just introduce the necessary instructions at the cursor."
msgstr ""
"Non modificare il codice già presente nell’editor. Inserisci solo le "
"istruzioni necessarie al cursore."

#. type: Plain text
#: ../help/help.E.txt:25
#, no-wrap
msgid "You will need the following instructions:"
msgstr "Ti serviranno queste istruzioni:"

#. type: Source code
#: ../help/help.E.txt:27
#, no-wrap
msgid "aim(0);<n/>"
msgstr "aim(0);<n/>"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../help/help.E.txt:28
#, no-wrap
msgid "<n/>Puts the cannon straight."
msgstr "<n/>Orienta il cannone orizzontalmente."

#. type: Source code
#: ../help/help.E.txt:30
#, no-wrap
msgid "turn();<n/>"
msgstr "turn();<n/>"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../help/help.E.txt:31
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<n/>Executes a rotation of a certain angle, given in brackets in degrees. "
"For example <c/>turn(90);<n/> will turn the bot 90 degrees to the left, i.e."
" a quarter turn to the left. <c/>turn(-90);<n/> will turn the bot 90 degrees"
" to the right (quarter turn right). Positive values turn left, negative "
"values turn right. <c/>turn(180);<n/> will make the bot face in the opposite"
" direction."
msgstr ""
"<n/>Ruota dell’angolo in gradi fra parentesi. <c/>turn(90);<n/> gira di 90 "
"gradi a sinistra, un quarto di giro. <c/>turn(-90);<n/> gira di un quarto a "
"destra. Positivo gira a sinistra, negativo a destra. <c/>turn(180);<n/> "
"inverte la direzione."

#. type: Source code
#: ../help/help.E.txt:33
#, no-wrap
msgid "fire(1);"
msgstr "fire(1);"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../help/help.E.txt:34
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<n/>Shoots the cannon. The number in brackets indicates the duration of the "
"burst. In most cases, shoot a burst of 1 second."
msgstr ""
"<n/>Spara con il cannone. Il numero indica la durata della raffica. Di "
"solito basta 1 secondo."

#. type: Bullet: 'o'
#: ../help/help.E.txt:37
#, no-wrap
msgid "put the cannon straight with <c/>aim(0);<n/>"
msgstr "orienta il cannone orizzontalmente con <c/>aim(0);<n/>"

#. type: Bullet: 'o'
#: ../help/help.E.txt:38
#, no-wrap
msgid "shoot the spider straight ahead with <c/>fire(1);<n/>"
msgstr "spara al ragno davanti con <c/>fire(1);<n/>"

#. type: Bullet: 'o'
#: ../help/help.E.txt:39
#, no-wrap
msgid "turn 90 degrees left with <code>turn(90)</code>"
msgstr "gira di 90 gradi a sinistra con <code>turn(90)</code>"

#. type: Bullet: 'o'
#: ../help/help.E.txt:40
#, no-wrap
msgid "shoot with <c/>fire(1);<n/>"
msgstr "spara con <c/>fire(1);<n/>"

#. type: Bullet: 'o'
#: ../help/help.E.txt:41
#, no-wrap
msgid "etc."
msgstr "ecc."

#. type: Plain text
#: ../help/help.E.txt:43
#, no-wrap
msgid "Here is the program that does all this :"
msgstr "Ecco il programma che fa tutto questo:"

#. type: Source code
#: ../help/help.E.txt:45
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"extern void object::Spider1( )\n"
"{\n"
"\t\n"
"\taim(0);\n"
"\tfire(1);\n"
"\tturn(90);\n"
"\tfire(1);\n"
"\t\n"
"}"
msgstr ""
"extern void object::Spider1( )\n"
"{\n"
"\t\n"
"\taim(0);\n"
"\tfire(1);\n"
"\tturn(90);\n"
"\tfire(1);\n"
"\t\n"
"}"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../help/help.E.txt:55
#, no-wrap
msgid "It is up to you now to write the rest of the program!"
msgstr "Ora tocca a te completare il programma!"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../help/help.E.txt:57
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"If you have got a problem, you can always look at the solution: select the "
"<code>Solution</code> program on the lower left-hand corner of the screen, "
"and click the braces button <button 22/>. You can even execute the solution "
"program with the arrow button <button 21/>."
msgstr ""
"Se hai difficoltà, consulta la soluzione: seleziona il programma "
"<code>Solution</code> in basso a sinistra e premi le graffe <button 22/>. "
"Puoi anche eseguirlo con la freccia <button 21/>."

#. type: \t; header
#: ../help/help.E.txt:59
#, no-wrap
msgid "Remarks"
msgstr "Osservazioni"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../help/help.E.txt:60
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Be careful to write the instructions precisely, respecting lower and upper "
"case letters."
msgstr ""
"Scrivi le istruzioni con precisione, rispettando maiuscole e minuscole."

#. type: Plain text
#: ../help/help.E.txt:62
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Always write one instruction per line, finishing each line with a semicolon."
msgstr ""
"Scrivi un’istruzione per riga, terminandola sempre con un punto e virgola."

#. type: Plain text
#: ../help/help.E.txt:64
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"In case your program does not do exactly what you wanted, you can put the "
"bot back at the starting point with the <button 59/> button. You can also "
"start over again from the beginning (hit the \"Esc\" key, then click "
"\"Restart\"). The program you have written will not be lost."
msgstr ""
"Se il programma non fa ciò che volevi, riporta il robot alla partenza con "
"<button 59/>. Puoi anche ricominciare premendo Esc e «Ricomincia»: il "
"programma non andrà perso."

#. type: Plain text
#: ../help/help.E.txt:66
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<format key><key help/></format> allows you to review these instructions at "
"all times."
msgstr ""
"<format key><key help/></format> permette di rileggere queste istruzioni in "
"ogni momento."

#. type: Plain text
#: ../help/help.E.txt:36
#, no-wrap
msgid "Let us see the beginning of the program:"
msgstr "Vediamo l’inizio del programma:"
